--- create meta-mine:recipes-app/widget/widget_1.2.bb
SUMMARY = "A widget"
LICENSE = "MIT"
LIC_FILES_CHKSUM = "file://LICENSE;md5=0835ade698e0bcf8506ecda2f7b4f302"

GO_IMPORT = "github.com/example/widget"

SRC_URI = "git://github.com/example/widget.git;protocol=https;branch=main;destsuffix=${GO_SRCURI_DESTSUFFIX}"
SRCREV = "89abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef"

inherit go
note: go: no SRC_URI form works on every release the layer claims; this follows the workspace release (wrynose) and will not work on kirkstone scarthgap
note: class go was not found in the indexed layers; it is the OE-core name, so the layer needs OE-core (or the layer that provides it) in BBLAYERS
